("v0", "entry", "v21")
("v21", "type", "Entry")
("v21", "key", "boundaries")
("v22", "type", "Sequence")
("v23", "type", "String")
("v23", "scalar", "Original reader/workshop JavaScript is a local verification oracle only; the shipped reader, activities and workshop execute admitted process algebra.")
("v22", "item", "v23")
("v24", "type", "String")
("v24", "scalar", "New page and microsite application policy runs through Temple algebra; generated browser bundles execute those programmes. Original microsite application scripts remain verification-only.")
("v22", "item", "v24")
("v25", "type", "String")
("v25", "scalar", "Build admission is not scientific validation. All shipped application behaviour is algebra-owned; native ports provide generic mechanisms.")
("v22", "item", "v25")
("v26", "type", "String")
("v26", "scalar", "Generated HTML and CSS are disposable. The current 20,000,000-step budget and kernel are unchanged.")
("v22", "item", "v26")
("v27", "type", "String")
("v27", "scalar", "Existing workshop, module and research-library URLs are preserved as exact-byte compatibility aliases. The original reader also remains at /reader.html.")
("v22", "item", "v27")
